lassic move! Lure a drunk Skuf to a spot where someone recently relieved themselves and let them feel the full weight of your treachery!<br>3. Quick Snack: Low health and getting beat up by heavy-drinking guys? No worries! Wet pet food is always on hand to quickly replenish your health!<br><br>No Skufs were harmed in the making of this game, but some Quadrobers might have been.</p>",
